    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:714f66f1-240b-4273-a9c7-23497efd0182",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:714f66f1-240b-4273-a9c7-23497efd0182/9847d8d1-ef20-4ccc-b9c7-de36e879b974/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:714f66f1-240b-4273-a9c7-23497efd0182/9847d8d1-ef20-4ccc-b9c7-de36e879b974/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:714f66f1-240b-4273-a9c7-23497efd0182/9847d8d1-ef20-4ccc-b9c7-de36e879b974/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:714f66f1-240b-4273-a9c7-23497efd0182/9847d8d1-ef20-4ccc-b9c7-de36e879b974/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Justin Simpson",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A714f66f1-240b-4273-a9c7-23497efd0182",
      "timeZone": "America/Vancouver"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I have updated the wiki page at ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Export+Format"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Export+Format",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " with some more information about how to perform a basic test with the Camel Serializer.  ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I can add more detailed installation instructions, for situations when the user is not using the vagrant box.  But I think those instructions should be added to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " perhaps, rather than to this wiki page.  And I am not sure extra install instructions are required.  ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I assume the point of this ticket is to document a reproducible test case, and the output of the Serializer.  That might mean that this ticket can be closed now?  Happy to add more info if anything else would be useful.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
