      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The updates to the wiki page looks good. The one suggestion I would make is to clearly detail the mapping between the Fedora resources and their serialization on disk.<br/>\nFor example, including in the wiki something like:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://host/fcrepo/rest/album\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://host/fcrepo/rest/album</a> --&gt; /tmp/descriptions/albums<br/>\n<a href=\"http://host/fcrepo/rest/album/ea/50/12/93/ea501293-64bf-430e-bf97-abcd64fda0c4\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://host/fcrepo/rest/album/ea/50/12/93/ea501293-64bf-430e-bf97-abcd64fda0c4</a> --&gt; /tmp/descriptions/albums/ea/50/12/93/ea501293-64bf-430e-bf97-abcd64fda0c4.ttl</p>",
